{"id":"eh","lemma":"eh","pos":"intj","rank":180,"glosses":["hey! (used to call, draw attention, warn or reprehend)","uh, um (space filler in a conversation, expression of hesitation or pause in speech)","huh? (expresses confusion)"],"ipa":"/ˈe/","examples":[{"text":"¡Eh, yo te conozco!","en":"Hey. I know you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/128120"},{"text":"¡Eh!, ¿dónde está Tom?","en":"Hey, where's Tom?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799414"},{"text":"¡Eh! ¿Qué ha pasado?","en":"Hey, what happened?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/79815"},{"text":"¡Eh!, no eres Tom.","en":"Hey, you're not Tom.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799413"},{"text":"¡Eh, tú! ¿Qué haces?","en":"Hey, you! What are you doing?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642067"}]}